In Laudisism, The Three Poles from Manus' will are:

Epektinus, the King of Power; 
Drisvethia, the Lady of Wisdom; 
Zorlh, the Lord of Justice

The 5 most notorious demons in Laudisism history are:
Didelis of Greed; 
Kruvni of Wrath; 
Mir of Lust; 
Narciuz of Arrogance;
Avalus of Sham
